{meta title='Breaking a while', about='A loop with a generous condition, left as soon as the sum passes 20.'}
{set $sum = 0}
{set $add = 0}
<p>
{while $add lt 100}
  {increment $add}
  {set $sum = $sum + $add}
  {if $sum gt 20}{break}{/if}
  {$sum}
{/while}
</p>
<p>Stopped when adding {$add} made {$sum}.</p>
